# The catalog cannot be read for the first nine seconds; a turn streams and
# holds; `/model ` opens the inline column over the failure while it runs.
# fx's column lists its models through `ensureModelCache` in every frame that
# draws it (`footerContext`, `app_render_runtime.zig:561-563`), held to the
# one-second floor (`beginLoad`, `model_cache_runtime.zig:441-442`), and while
# the turn streams its activity row animates every 50 ms
# (`advanceVisibleAnimation`, `app_worker_runtime.zig:840-875`) -- so the
# column asks again about once a second, and turns into the rows once the
# catalog is back. `modelsdelay 0` stamps each read in the gateway log.
models models.json
modelsdown 9000
modelsdelay 0
gateway model-reask-turns.json
wait 4.5
snap start
type say something
key Enter
wait 1
type /model
key Space
wait 0.7
snap col-down
wait 5
snap col-back
gwlog
